{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"范畴的范畴"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Cat"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>一般而言, 某种范畴构成的全体是一个更高一阶的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为完备 Segal 对象的范畴</h3>\n<p>见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal空间","text":"Segal 空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>余极限</h3>\n"}]}}